Use the **china-clinical-trials** skill to query Chinese clinical trial registration information.

## Output Format

```
【临床试验信息】
登记号：[trial_id]
试验名称：[trial_name]
药品名称：[drug_name]
适应症：[indication]
试验分期：[phase]
试验状态：[status]
```
